OL,3,AMuted US response to UK's West Bank
OL,4,Asanctions may reflect simmering
OL,5,Afrustration
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs the UK unveiled sanctions against
OL,8,FIsraeli settlements in the occupied
OL,9,FWest Bank on Tuesday, Israel responded
OL,10,Fwith fury, declaring it would shutter
OL,11,FBritain's diplomatic mission to the
OL,12,FPalestinians, kick out UK military
OL,13,Fstaff from an international
OL,14,Fcoordination base near Gaza and ban
OL,15,Fnearly a dozen left-wing British
OL,16,Fmembers of parliament from entering
OL,17,FIsrael.
OL,19,FIt was a blaring signal of defiance and
OL,20,Fa remarkable diplomatic escalation.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
