OL,3,AMuted US response to UK's West Bank
OL,4,Asanctions may reflect simmering
OL,5,Afrustration
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK had taken the action arguing it
OL,8,Fhad a moral imperative to stop the
OL,9,F"destruction" of the two-state solution
OL,10,F- a future independent Palestinian
OL,11,Fstate - at the hands of the Israeli
OL,12,Fgovernment. It accused Israel's
OL,13,Fgovernment of turning a blind eye to
OL,14,Fthe "ethnic cleansing" of Palestinians
OL,15,Fby settlers.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
