OL,3,AMuted US response to UK's West Bank
OL,4,Asanctions may reflect simmering
OL,5,Afrustration
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe standoff, which by the afternoon
OL,8,Fextended to a further 11 mostly
OL,9,FEuropean countries set to join the
OL,10,Fsettlement trade ban, raised a crucial
OL,11,Fquestion: When Israel becomes isolated,
OL,12,Fthe US as its superpower backer often
OL,13,Fsteps in to provide a diplomatic
OL,14,Fshield. Was the US, too, going to
OL,15,Fcondemn Britain's policy?
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
